  "instructions": [
    "In a small bowl , stir together the soy sauce , peanut butter , vinegar , and cayenne pepper",
    "Set aside",
    "Heat oil in a skillet or wok over high heat",
    "Add chicken , garlic and ginger , and cook , stirring constantly , until chicken is golden on the outside , about 5 minutes",
    "Reduce heat to medium , and add green onion , broccoli , peppers peanuts , and the peanut butter mixture",
    "Cook , stirring frequently , for 8 to 10 minutes , or until broccoli is tender , and chicken is cooked through",
